OL,3,GNEWSA'Home Affairs will have to live
OL,4,Awith cuts'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's Home Affairs Committee will
OL,7,F"just have to live" with making cuts,
OL,8,Fthe island's treasury lead has said.
OL,10,FThe committee warned that, without an
OL,11,Fextra #2.2m to #3.9m, it would not be
OL,12,Fable to maintain front line services,
OL,13,Fsuch as police and fire services, at
OL,14,Fthe current level.
OL,16,FPolicy and Resources Committee member
OL,17,FDeputy Charles Parkinson said the
OL,18,Fgovernment could only invest "what they
OL,19,Fcan afford".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
